   - **Ping responder — ACCEPT, Medium.** “Two unanswered” imposes a peer obligation without identifying WebSocket ping/pong, an application value, or the responding component ([implementation-plan.md:334](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/docs/design/dao.stream.implementation-plan.md:334).
   - **ADR 0003 time-box — UNVERIFIABLE.** The ADR is outside the permitted scope. From the in-scope text I can verify only that the time-box is asserted at [dao.stream.ws.md:67](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/docs/design/dao.stream.ws.md:67), not its terms or whether the plan carries them correctly.
